          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Yesterday afternoon while walking the dog: gradual onset over approximately 5–10 minutes of dull central chest pressure with slight heaviness into the left upper arm; lasted approximately 15–20 minutes and resolved with rest. Associated increased dizziness, clamminess, and nausea."
      }
